=2 Walkthrough
* Trade enough {p:Crystals|Crystal} to the {p:Conquest NPC} to raise your Rank bar and unlock the Mission, then accept it from the {n:Gate Guard}.
** 3 {p:Crystals|Crystal} seems to be enough.
** **(Optional):** Talk to {p:Cid} in {z:Bastok Metalworks|Metalworks} for more information.
* You will have to obtain a {@i:Faded Crystal|613} {i:Faded Crystal|Faded Crystal|613} and trade it to {p:Cid} to receive the {@k} {k:C. L. report}.
** {@i:Faded Crystal|613} {i:Faded Crystal|Faded Crystal|613}s are not Exclusive, and can be traded or purchased from Bazaars or the {z:Auction House}. ({@g:Auction House} > Others > Misc. 1)
** Alternatively, it can be obtained by trading a {p:Synthesis Crystal} to any Crag's {p:Telepoint}:
*** {p:Crag of Dem} - {z:Konschtat Highlands} (I-6)
*** {p:Crag of Holla} - {z:La Theine Plateau} (K-8)
*** {p:Crag of Mea} - {z:Tahrongi Canyon} (I-6)
*** You can easily teleport to any of these zones by talking to a {p:Unity NPC} and using the Lvl 99 {p:Unity} Warps.
** **(Optional):** Talk to {p:Naji}.
* Speak to {p:Ayame} in the **Cannonry** at (K-7) in the {z:Metalworks} to finish the Mission.
** You may have to speak to her several times to receive the correct dialogue.

=2 Notes
* If you're leveling up, make sure to accept the {p:Records of Eminence} objective **Colorless (W)** for extra EXP.
** This is under: Quests > Objective List > Vana'versary (scroll down to see it) > 15th Vana'versary II
* This Mission is an excellent opportunity for first-time players to obtain a {@k} {k:Dem gate crystal}.
* Since the implementation of the {@g:Chains of Promathia} {p:Chains of Promathia} expansion, the north platform of the {p:Crag of Dem} is the only remaining {p:Telepoint} in {z:Konschtat Highlands} that can be used to obtain a {@i:Faded Crystal|613} {i:Faded Crystal|Faded Crystal|613}.

